# Storing superscript variables until there is no room. E-364 p. 15: "there
# is room for a total of 250 such variables." The 251st, x|251, stops the
# program with a post-mortem (section 16), and equation 100 types n, which is
# where it got to.
    n = 0,
1   n = n + 1,
    x|n = n,
    SP 1,
100 PRINT n.
    STOP
